1
00:01:37,730 --> 00:01:41,030
Sinbad, Her Excellency is expecting you.

2
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:49,580
Ja'far, are we gonna be executed?

3
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:51,750
We've come all this way.

4
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,830
I just can't die here!

5
00:01:54,170 --> 00:01:56,130
Calm down, Mystras.

6
00:01:56,210 --> 00:01:57,340
But...

7
00:01:59,170 --> 00:02:01,050
Your Excellency, they are present.

8
00:02:05,010 --> 00:02:08,310
Where were you?
I was getting tired of waiting.

9
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,390
Oh, my--!

10
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:15,480
Your Excellency,
to have an audience with you once again

11
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:17,360
is a great honor.

12
00:02:19,650 --> 00:02:23,360
Enough of that.
Do you think you can get away with this?

13
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:25,530
My skin was scarred

14
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:27,450
from yesterday's battle.

15
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,870
My beautiful body is ruined.

16
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,870
But it's been a long time
since I felt such excitement.

17
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:40,880
You're the first man to ever pin me down
and defeat me, Sinbad.

18
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:45,340
Last night was unforgettable for me, too.

19
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:53,800
At this time, the decision has been made

20
00:02:53,890 --> 00:02:57,850
for Artemyra to officially join hands
with Sindria Trading Company.

21
00:02:58,770 --> 00:03:02,150
As queen, this is the first time
I've formed a contract with a company.

22
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:07,700
I reread the terms of trade
that were proposed in the letter.

23
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,910
It's not a bad deal.

24
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:14,790
I will dispatch a diplomat
from our country to your company.

25
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:18,080
We will collaborate as much as we can.

26
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:22,920
As our isolated country flourishes
with more commerce,

27
00:03:23,010 --> 00:03:25,340
the lives of our citizens
will be enriched.

28
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,720
Thank you very much, Your Excellency.

29
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:32,350
I'm speaking now from a public position.

30
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:34,640
The truth is,

31
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:38,560
I don't want you as an enemy, Sinbad.

32
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:43,070
Even with such great powers,
you devote yourself as a merchant.

33
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:46,820
What are you trying to do
by coming out here?

34
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:49,570
What is your true agenda?

35
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:55,290
Your Excellency, I have a dream
that must be realized.

36
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,960
When you held that Metal Vessel,

37
00:03:58,290 --> 00:04:00,540
didn't you sense the weight of its power?

38
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:05,670
My duty as the King Vessel,
recognized by the Djinn,

39
00:04:06,550 --> 00:04:08,890
is to create a world without war.

40
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:12,470
And I need your help,
your cooperation to make it happen.

41
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,180
A world without war?

42
00:04:16,350 --> 00:04:17,190
Yes.

43
00:04:19,190 --> 00:04:22,570
This Metal Vessel will trigger a new war

44
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:25,940
that will threaten
the equilibrium of the world.

45
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:31,280
In order to prevent and be prepared
for such a situation,

46
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:36,080
I must share ideologies with powerful
figures like you to establish an alliance.

47
00:04:37,330 --> 00:04:41,080
That's how we can achieve
a "world of acceptance."

48
00:04:42,210 --> 00:04:46,340
You're asking Artemyra to join
that world of acceptance?

49
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:50,340
So far, I've already formed an alliance
with Rametoto of Imuchakk

50
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:53,810
and Darius, the Knight-King of Sasan.

51
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:58,850
You formed an alliance with countries
that ban foreigners?

52
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:05,070
This is Mystras Leoxses,
the son of the Knight-King.

53
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:08,950
He travels with us
as a representative of Sasan.

54
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:13,490
Sasan is not a wealthy country either.

55
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:17,700
I'm sure the Knight-King would've
eventually invaded neighboring countries

56
00:05:17,790 --> 00:05:19,410
to expand his territory.

57
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:25,290
The immense power of the Metal Vessel
makes conquering nations a piece of cake.

58
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:28,210
But he lost, didn't he?

59
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:31,550
He was defeated by you, like I was.

60
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:36,560
If you wanted to,
you could destroy a whole country.

61
00:05:37,890 --> 00:05:42,730
The Knight-King must have surrendered to
your power and agreed to form an alliance.

62
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:48,610
Sasan has an established relationship
with Reim, too.

63
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:52,820
If the legendary sorceress of Reim knew
about the Metal Vessel,

64
00:05:52,910 --> 00:05:54,700
things could've been very different.

65
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:57,410
The "legendary sorceress" of Reim?

66
00:05:58,580 --> 00:06:02,330
You must know
if you're a merchant of Reim.

67
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:06,540
We're not familiar with Reim territory,
aside from Napolia.

68
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,210
The legendary sorceress of Reim...

69
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:15,180
devoted herself to Reim,
supporting the empire's prosperity.

70
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:17,850
She's a sorcerer
who's lived for 200 years.

71
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:20,770
A legendary "Magi."

72
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,060
Two hundred years?

73
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:25,900
A legendary Magi?

74
00:06:26,610 --> 00:06:30,030
Excuse my ignorance, but what is a Magi?

75
00:06:31,610 --> 00:06:34,320
It's still an obscure existence.

76
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:38,200
But they appear in legends
all over the world.

77
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,540
They've appeared during crucial times
in history

78
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:44,080
to guide the lives of many
and enlighten the world.

79
00:06:44,870 --> 00:06:47,250
They are the great sorcerers of creation,

80
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:51,590
with a special calling
as the "selectors of the king."

81
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,550
That's the Magi.

82
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,300
Magi...

83
00:06:57,050 --> 00:06:59,470
The Magi possess power
beyond human understanding.

84
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:05,440
When they swing their wand, a tower
appears where the king's power is stored.

85
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:09,150
They have the ability to guide
the chosen one as the king.

86
00:07:10,110 --> 00:07:12,740
We think that these Dungeons
appearing all over the world

87
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:15,610
are the towers mentioned in the legend.

88
00:07:18,030 --> 00:07:20,580
Magi... Dungeon...

89
00:07:23,410 --> 00:07:24,580
Yunan?

90
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:28,460
Can he be a Magi?

91
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:31,590
I always thought he was a strange guy.

92
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:36,930
Your Excellency,
what kind of person is the Magi?

93
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,550
I've told you already.

94
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,760
They are still a mystery.

95
00:07:42,470 --> 00:07:44,430
But if I were to say anything,

96
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,690
I believe Magi are those
who are blessed by the "Rukh."

97
00:07:49,230 --> 00:07:50,190
Rukh?

98
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:53,820
The Rukh are the headwaters of life

99
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:55,860
that flow through this world.

100
00:07:56,900 --> 00:08:00,280
Magi that are blessed by Rukh...

101
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:03,490
could be the embodiment
of our world's will.

102
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:08,080
That could explain why the Dungeons

103
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:11,710
are appearing all over the world
and how we're both Capturers.

104
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:16,670
There might be some force
that's influencing this to happen.

105
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:22,100
In any case, you're the only man
I've ever approved of.

106
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:24,350
Let's form an alliance.

107
00:08:26,850 --> 00:08:28,600
Thank you very much, Your Excellency.

108
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:36,650
I'm relieved
that it worked out peacefully.

109
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:41,370
I got concerned when you started
to fight with your Djinn Equip.

110
00:08:42,070 --> 00:08:43,830
It turned out to be okay.

111
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:47,750
This is exactly what happened in Sasan!
We were worried sick!

112
00:08:47,830 --> 00:08:49,830
Can't you understand that by now?!

113
00:08:50,330 --> 00:08:53,340
So, we're leaving tomorrow, right?

114
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,670
Yes, that's the plan.

115
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:59,090
Does that mean
we have free time until then?!

116
00:08:59,930 --> 00:09:02,010
Sure, that's no problem.

117
00:09:02,510 --> 00:09:03,850
But are you all right?

118
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:07,180
What? What? I'm fine.

119
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,270
What are you hiding?

120
00:09:09,850 --> 00:09:10,980
Nothing!

121
00:09:11,350 --> 00:09:14,070
I'm not about to have a good time
with a lady.

122
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,780
You're the worst liar!

123
00:09:16,070 --> 00:09:17,490
Explain in detail!

124
00:09:17,990 --> 00:09:19,990
I told you that I wasn't!

125
00:09:20,070 --> 00:09:21,360
Tell me!

126
00:09:21,450 --> 00:09:22,370
Never!

127
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:25,200
Hey, aren't you the boy from before?

128
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:28,450
So, you really did survive
the Valley of the Dead.

129
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,790
The queen was very impressed,

130
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,880
praising you all for having backbone.

131
00:09:34,590 --> 00:09:35,800
Is that true?!

132
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:39,170
I'm so glad I made it out alive for you,
my lady!

133
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:42,930
Do you want your reward that badly?

134
00:09:43,010 --> 00:09:43,890
Yes!

135
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,850
How adorable.

136
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:48,140
He was so desperate

137
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:50,980
to escape the valley

138
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:53,520
for this reason?!

139
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:59,070
I think I'm forgetting
about something very important.

140
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:03,030
By the way, we're going to release
the other man who was in our custody.

141
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,320
We're reluctant to let him go...

142
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,090
Hinahoho?

143
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,840
Imuchakk man, you're welcome back anytime!

144
00:10:21,090 --> 00:10:23,260
It was a pleasure to have you!

145
00:10:24,090 --> 00:10:28,010
He was extremely cooperative
with our research!

146
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:32,180
It felt great--
No, you were a great help!

147
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,310
Thanks a lot, Hinahoho.

148
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:36,020
Hinahoho...

149
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:37,690
How about Rurumu?

150
00:10:37,770 --> 00:10:39,690
I'm not a bad person!

151
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:42,030
I swear I didn't cross that line...

152
00:10:42,110 --> 00:10:45,530
-Hina...
-I didn't do anything wrong!

153
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:49,740
Hinahoho!

154
00:10:49,830 --> 00:10:53,410
You were having that much fun while
we were trying to survive in the valley?!

155
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:55,370
That's just cruel! So cruel of you!

156
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:56,960
I'm the one who wanted

157
00:10:57,040 --> 00:11:01,340
to do this and that with a beautiful lady!
How could you?!

158
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,880
Mystras, stop crying.

159
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,930
What happened to Hinahoho was beyond us.

160
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:09,890
Focus on how we still have a future.

161
00:11:11,930 --> 00:11:13,060
Sinbad...

162
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:15,690
The road was already laid out for us.

163
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:20,820
Remember the heavenly place that
stimulates our most intellectual desires?

164
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:23,400
Yes, our harem...

165
00:11:25,150 --> 00:11:26,240
The red-light district!

166
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,780
Are there beautiful ladies
in the red-light district?

167
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:31,910
Yeah, of course!

168
00:11:31,990 --> 00:11:34,830
Can we have fun with the ladies
in the red-light district?!

169
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:35,790
Of course we can!

170
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:37,830
I'll follow you for the rest of my life!

171
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,380
All right! Follow me!

172
00:11:41,090 --> 00:11:44,420
So, we are going
to the red-light district after all.

173
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:47,380
I did nothing wrong.
I did nothing wrong.

174
00:11:54,930 --> 00:11:56,350
Hello there!

175
00:11:59,980 --> 00:12:02,440
-Thank you for waiting.
-Yes!

176
00:12:03,110 --> 00:12:04,860
Is this your first visit?

177
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,570
We strive to offer you only the best.

178
00:12:08,450 --> 00:12:09,910
Please enjoy our wonderful men

179
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:11,700
to your heart's content!

180
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:29,680
Good morning.

181
00:12:30,890 --> 00:12:33,350
I will be joining you, starting today.

182
00:12:33,430 --> 00:12:35,930
I'm Parsine Pratemia, the diplomat.

183
00:12:36,770 --> 00:12:38,480
As a representative of the alliance

184
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:41,650
and a structural agent
to organize commerce,

185
00:12:41,730 --> 00:12:43,900
I will do my best work
as part of your team.

186
00:12:45,900 --> 00:12:47,950
What's the matter with them?

187
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,450
Oh, don't mind them.

188
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:52,910
Macho fest...

189
00:12:52,990 --> 00:12:55,950
Quit it, Mystras.
I want to forget that image.

190
00:12:57,710 --> 00:13:00,580
Well, if they're not feeling well,

191
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:02,080
we can head out tomorrow?

192
00:13:02,170 --> 00:13:03,840
-Please let us leave today!
-Please let us leave today!

193
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:11,390
They will take us to the boat
docked at sea.

194
00:13:12,340 --> 00:13:15,260
It's time to say goodbye
to Artemyra for a while.

195
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:19,560
Yeah... A lot happened
while we were here.

196
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:22,560
Not a lot of time has passed,

197
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:26,610
but it feels like I've been here
for quite some time.

198
00:13:27,610 --> 00:13:29,530
So, you're leaving today.

199
00:13:30,570 --> 00:13:32,870
Who's going to entertain me now?

200
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:36,450
I regret to see you leave.

201
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,120
Your Excellency!

202
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:41,500
What an honor to see you here.

203
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:42,750
Don't worry.

204
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:46,300
I'm fond of you all, that's all.

205
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:51,260
You might be taking care
of my daughters in the future,

206
00:13:51,970 --> 00:13:53,550
so I wanted express my salutations.

207
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:58,390
Knowledge of world affairs is crucial
to protect our country in the future.

208
00:13:58,470 --> 00:14:01,140
So, I want you to expand their knowledge.

209
00:14:02,310 --> 00:14:04,730
But that's still way ahead in the future.

210
00:14:05,230 --> 00:14:06,730
What?!

211
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,360
Aren't they cute? They're my daughters.

212
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:14,740
Your Excellency, you are truly blessed
to have so many children.

213
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:17,580
It's quite common in our country.

214
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:20,540
I also have... another one.

215
00:14:21,330 --> 00:14:22,160
What--?

216
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:28,460
You must be her favorite.

217
00:14:30,130 --> 00:14:32,970
Her name is Pisti,
the youngest of them all.

218
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:36,140
She can already take control
of our giant birds.

219
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:37,760
She's one of our strongest.

220
00:14:38,350 --> 00:14:40,310
I'm excited about her future.

221
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:43,480
-For me?
-Yup.

222
00:14:50,570 --> 00:14:55,240
That feather represents the Rukh Bird
of luck in our country.

223
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:59,370
Sinbad, I sincerely hope

224
00:14:59,450 --> 00:15:02,120
that your journey will be blessed
by the Rukh.

225
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,920
Yes!

226
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,720
Mother, I...

227
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:24,560
smelled the great ocean on that man.

228
00:15:25,230 --> 00:15:28,150
Pisti never met anyone like that before.

229
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,650
I know.

230
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:34,400
Your mother's never encountered
a man like that before either.

231
00:15:37,110 --> 00:15:41,200
Let us bear witness
to how this man will...

232
00:15:41,990 --> 00:15:43,790
change the world.

233
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,430
Sindria Trading Company
thrives again today!

234
00:15:58,010 --> 00:15:58,840
Everyone!

235
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:00,680
President Sinbad!

236
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:02,430
You've returned.

237
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:07,060
I apologize for my long absence.

238
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:11,190
I need to speak to Rurumu,
to get updated on our current situation.

239
00:16:11,820 --> 00:16:15,860
Since it's her last month of pregnancy,
she's currently back home.

240
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,990
How is Rurumu?

241
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,370
Healthy and full of spirit.

242
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:22,740
Both her and her baby.

243
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,450
What a relief.

244
00:16:25,330 --> 00:16:29,250
So, he must be taking Rurumu's place...

245
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:34,340
Hey, Vitte--

246
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,770
-Oh, man.
-Vittel.

247
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:48,020
Sin?! You're back!

248
00:16:48,310 --> 00:16:51,940
Yup. Thanks for taking care of the company
while I was gone.

249
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:53,610
It must've been busy.

250
00:16:54,230 --> 00:16:55,110
Thanks a lot.

251
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:57,150
Sin...

252
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:02,160
So... take care of those bills for me!

253
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:06,450
But I thought we already took care
of travel expenses...

254
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:09,250
What do you mean? I've returned.

255
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:11,710
So, that means...

256
00:17:12,210 --> 00:17:13,040
Exactly.

257
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:15,460
Time for a banquet!

258
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:20,340
Let me introduce you all
to our newest members.

259
00:17:21,010 --> 00:17:22,470
Mystras of Sasan.

260
00:17:23,050 --> 00:17:26,470
He's the son of the Knight-King of Sasan,
a great knight himself.

261
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:27,890
Nice to meet you!

262
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,940
We also have Parsine of Artemyra.

263
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:34,110
She serves as a diplomat of Artemyra.

264
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:37,990
They represent Sasan and Artemyra
respectively, and symbolize...

265
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:40,490
our friendships with each nation.

266
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:43,450
Please welcome our new comrades.

267
00:17:43,910 --> 00:17:46,660
Mystras is also single, by the way!

268
00:17:46,990 --> 00:17:48,160
Hey!

269
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:52,500
Parsine is scary when she gets mad,
so try not to get on her bad side.

270
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:55,960
All right, everyone!

271
00:17:56,880 --> 00:18:00,090
Sindria Company will only continue
to expand.

272
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:03,390
Sasan, Artemyra and Imuchakk,

273
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:07,350
these three countries are
our reliable allies,

274
00:18:07,430 --> 00:18:08,770
allowing us to have a future.

275
00:18:09,770 --> 00:18:12,230
Our workload and personnel
will continue to increase.

276
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:14,730
But I believe that we can handle it.

277
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:18,400
Sindria Trading Company
will become Napolia's--

278
00:18:18,820 --> 00:18:22,280
No. Reim's leading company!

279
00:18:23,570 --> 00:18:25,120
Let's create our nation!

280
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:27,410
For the ideal future!

281
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:28,660
Yeah!

282
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:09,650
Sin... what's the matter?

283
00:20:10,350 --> 00:20:12,610
Everyone wants to talk to you.

284
00:20:14,070 --> 00:20:17,530
Sindria Trading Company
has come a long way.

285
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:22,740
Yes, we've become
a prominent company of Napolia.

286
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:29,120
I believe it's all because
of the people we've met so far.

287
00:20:34,130 --> 00:20:36,090
Each and every encounter was essential.

288
00:20:38,970 --> 00:20:42,590
We made it here because of our comrades.

289
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:54,020
I feel like there's a great force

290
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:57,480
that's drawing us together.

291
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:10,330
I see it.

292
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:18,010
I see it all.

293
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:21,170
I know where I'm going.

294
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:03,130
I... am special.

295
00:22:07,180 --> 00:22:10,560
Sinbad was only 16 years old at the time.

296
00:22:11,430 --> 00:22:15,060
Destiny swept him
and those around him

297
00:22:15,150 --> 00:22:17,560
up in a great big swell.

298
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:22,320
The world was about to face

299
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:24,780
an unexpected future of change.

